# Never retain local transfer archives or old repository snapshots. Canonical
# Architecture v2 reference ZIPs remain intentionally tracked by name.
*.rar
*.7z
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*_snapshot.zip
*_backup.zip
*.tmp
*.bak

# Godot editor sidecars generated while opening reference-only review scenes.
# Runtime art import files already tracked under demo/hospital_integration/art
# remain tracked; user-owned capture sidecars stay visible as untracked work.
.qa/
demo/hospital_integration/*.gd.uid
demo/hospital_integration/repair_candidates/**/*.png.import
